  "translations": {
    "translations": [
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "ES",
        "iso_639_1": "es",
        "name": "Español",
        "english_name": "Spanish",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "En 2017 el mundo perdió a David Delfín tras una ardua batalla contra el cáncer.  Tomando como punto de partida el controvertido desfile de la colección Cour des miracles en 2002, y contando con las intervenciones de personas cercanas, el film muestra al artista en todas sus facetas: desde sus trabajos hasta sus esferas íntimas como hijo, hermano, novio o amigo.",
          "runtime": 75,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "US",
        "iso_639_1": "en",
        "name": "English",
        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "A documentary that takes an emotional journey through the life and career of David Delfín, a unique, controversial, and revolutionary artist who was much more than a fashion designer. It portrays a complete and multidisciplinary creator who used couture to express himself and the catwalk as his megaphone. Beginning with the scandalous 2002 Cour des miracles show—known as “the rope show”—the film explores his artistic vision and his intimate world as a son, brother, boyfriend, and friend. Through moving testimonies from those closest to him, it reveals both his brilliance and vulnerability. In a tragic twist of fate, Delfín and his soulmate, model Bimba Bosé, were both diagnosed with cancer at nearly the same time; she died in January 2017, and he followed five months later.",
          "runtime": 75,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "ES",
        "iso_639_1": "ca",
        "name": "Català",
        "english_name": "Catalan",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "A tots els cors hi ha una esquerda, i per allà hi entra la llum. El cor del David tenia esgarrapades, com el de qualsevol jove que deixa la seva terra per a anar a la gran ciutat. Però a Madrid troba la seva tribu; crea la marca Davidelfín el 2001 amb els germans Postigo i Bimba Bosé, i en els dissenys hi bolca les seves obsessions: Magritte, Beuys, Bourgeois, la psicoanàlisi, la identitat, l'element dissonant, la malaltia. El documental recorre una vida i una trajectòria dedicades a «estimar i treballar», com deia el mateix David citant Freud. Amb la moda com a refugi constant, també va fer incursions en la fotografia, el vídeo, la música i el cinema. La cerca és sempre la mateixa: bellesa, delicadesa, desig.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      }
    ]
  },
